+/**
+ * Auto-export worker.
+ *
+ * Writes into the configured directory, never overwriting:
+ *   - one incremental CSV per table (rows added since the previous run, 1h overlap)
+ *   - a manifest JSON with a column dictionary, data-quality stats and dedup rules
+ *   - a full database snapshot daily (keep newest N)
+ *   - every raw .bin the Huawei support produced (whole-night beat-to-beat blobs)
+ *
+ * Columns are discovered from the schema at runtime, so adding a table needs one line.
+ * Local research patch: upstream only overwrites a single fixed file.
